    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεικάζω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῄκασα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make like, assimilate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					40a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.10.8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be like, resemble</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.247
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>liken, compare</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					431
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				559
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				473c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.8.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῷ δέ τῳ προσεικάζω τάδε</span>
			<i>I think</i> this <i>looks like</i> mischief, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1131
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔχω προσεικάσαι . . </span>I am not
			able <i>to guess by comparison</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				163
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>conjecture in addition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.5.8
			</span></i>.</div>
